  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Joshi Sachin Jagdish Sachin Joshi vs The State Of Telangana",
    "facts": "This application is filed under Section 482 Cr.P.C. to quash the proceedings in Crime No.51 of 2020 on the file of Bahadurpura Police Station, Hyderabad. The petitioner is Accused No.4 in the above said case. The offences alleged against the petitioner are under Sections 336, 273 r/w 34 of IPC. 2.",
    "arguments": "The learned counsel for the petitioner as well as the learned Assistant Public Prosecutor would submit that the subject matter is squarely covered by a common order dated 27.08.2018, passed by the High Court of Judicature at Hyderabad for the States of Telangana and Andhra Pradesh in Crl.P. No.3731 of 2018 and batch, and placed copy of the said judgment for perusal.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "The learned counsel for the petitioner as well as the learned Assistant Public Prosecutor would submit that the subject matter is squarely covered by a common order dated 27.08.2018, passed by the High Court of Judicature at Hyderabad for the States of Telangana and Andhra Pradesh in Crl.P. No.3731 of 2018 and batch, and placed copy of the said judgment for perusal.",
